@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Get All Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders HTTP/1.1

###

### 2. Get Orders by Customer ID
@customerId = b9a544ff-c7c4-4b53-b09e-7164998782a4
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?customerId={{customerId}} HTTP/1.1

###

### 3. Get Order by ID
@orderId = e12c478a-c85e-4ff6-9993-9c87d46c87cf
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}} HTTP/1.1
